4. Key Features
Keep this to a short list.
Automated part-number interpretation
* Handles different part-number structures.
* Produces numeric-like sorting rather than ordinary text sorting.
Dynamic header detection
* Finds required fields even when their column positions change.
* Supports anticipated header-name variations.
Three report options
* Part Number First
* Category First
* Line First
Built-in QA
* Checks important conditions before allowing normal report output.
* Uses data-integrity checks between processing stages.
Print-ready output
* Generates reports intended to be used directly in the warehouse.
* Includes sequential row numbers useful for physical inventory/shelf planning.
Minimal user interaction
* Processing complexity is hidden from normal users.
* Processing tabs are protected to reduce accidental changes.
